    {
      "Uid": 43,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이동식 발판이었다면 이런 게 왜 필요했을까요…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "移動式の踏み台だとしたら、どうしてこんなものが…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 44,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "으음, 왠지 이거…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "うーん。なんか、これ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 45,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…아! 반대로 생각해보는 거예요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…あっ！逆に考えてみるんです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 46,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_ELF",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>뭔가를 빨아들이기 위해서</color>, <color=#F7BE45>돌아다녀야 했던</color>거죠!",
